   SINGLE_ANISO (OPEN)
(last updated on 12-March-2018)
   New features: 

1.  Calculation of the SIGN of the product gX * gY * gZ for any moment;
2.  Calculation of the parameters of the Crystal-Field for lanthanides (CRYS).
3.  Automatic generation of various plot: (PLOT)
     -- Powder magnetic susceptibilty:  XT=f(T)
     -- Powder molar magnetization:  M=f(H,T)
4.  Support for various restart options: (REST)
     -- from  $Project.rassi.h5 file.
     -- from  $Project.aniso (binary) file.
     -- from  ANISOINPUT (ascii) file.
     -- from  $Project.RunFile file.
5.  RASSI was adjusted to provide more accurate tunnelling gaps between near-degenerate states
Check the MOLCAS manual for details and input examples.

